sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Proxy
    participant A as Interceptor A
    participant B as Interceptor B
    participant Target
    Caller->>Proxy: invoke()
    Proxy->>A: invoke
    A->>A: before A
    A->>B: proceed
    B->>B: before B
    B->>Target: invoke target
    Target-->>B: return / throw
    B->>B: after B
    B-->>A: return / throw
    A->>A: after A
    A-->>Proxy: return / throw
    Proxy-->>Caller: return / throw
